{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2025-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1748736000, "end_date": 1749340799, "month_true_total": 133, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:06:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "196664957", "author": {"steamid": "76561199214885600", "personaname": "Your Local Gadriel Lover", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199214885600/", "num_games_owned": 73, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2216, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1428, "last_played": 1782270975, "avatar": "28825c17293a5254b99d5c24ff8a208bd9c23080"}, "language": "english", "review": "My dear friend got this game for me while it was on sale and after playing through the entire campaign for the first time, I cannot recommend this game enough! The characters are unique, it has linear dialogue and it runs great without crashing and/or lagging much! It doesn't require a highly advanced computer to play on, which is also neat!\r\n\r\nI do have some issues with it, however. Not only it looks a bit unbalanced in some parts, but the camera sometimes glitches differently and the healing mechanic is... annoying at best, since the enemies can still hit you while you're executing. I hope they can improve this in the Master Crafted Edition.\r\n\r\nAll and all, still recommend this version! It's a nice way to get to know a bit about the Warhammer 40k universe!", "timestamp_created": 1749338229, "timestamp_updated": 1749338229, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "196634140", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972426340", "personaname": "RubberDucky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_